<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Leadership</h1>
<p>SKILL
</p><p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Necromancer -  3
 Dark Knight - 12
 Paladin     - 12
 Barbarian   - 15
 Fighter     - 15
 Ranger      - 16
</pre>
<p>A born leader, or one who has studied the skill, is something of value to their 
group: people want to follow a real leader. Leadership is used by itself; there 
is no command for it.
</p><p>For now it does one thing: when you rescue someone who follows you (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Rescue</a>), your leadership adds to your chance of succeeding.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Rescue</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Groups</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Follow</a>
</pre>




</div>